From 1621251c99c5586e9934d8545d94a5c6027136d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SCNya <SCNya@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 15:04:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] OpenBot Local: open the local workspace without an account

Ports the account-free logic from ocodista/free-openbot (codex/free-openbot) and
daMustermann/openbotfr onto current upstream main:
- AppAccessGate opens language step, first run, setup and workspace without sign-in
- central auth skips /health/live when there is no session
- analytics and failure reports never leave the computer
- auto-updates and openbot:// / desktop-entry registration disabled
- local host/team settings and conversations work without an account
- account-only settings tabs (profile, billing, phone) hidden; hosted server offers removed
- appId app.openbot.local, productName OpenBot Local, separate userData
